WEBVTT

00:01:29.156 --> 00:01:31.156
and I'm sitting with one
of my best friends

00:01:31.196 --> 00:01:33.116
and we're going to have this great meal,

00:01:33.116 --> 00:01:35.396
to just, I had the bottom fall out.

00:01:35.396 --> 00:01:37.516
And I couldn't put words
around what I felt,

00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:40.556
I felt pain, I felt shame,
I felt confusion.

00:01:40.596 --> 00:01:42.916
And I felt my joy leaving in that moment.

00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:45.916
And I don't know that I got it back
for the rest of the dinner.

00:01:45.916 --> 00:01:48.716
And what was so hard about it,
is Walter was a good friend,

00:01:48.756 --> 00:01:51.516
And I didn't have words
for what I was experiencing.

00:01:51.556 --> 00:01:54.356
I've thought about it a lot since then.

00:01:54.396 --> 00:01:56.996
Now I know that some
of what I was experiencing,

00:01:56.996 --> 00:01:59.156
is what women of color
face in the workplace,

00:01:59.196 --> 00:02:00.596
you can have the highest high